 "why_questionable": "Market data shows total debt of $11.1B against cash of $8.4B, a net debt of about $2.8B including leases. Net cash holds only if leases are excluded (about $7.9B debt versus $8.4B cash, a net cash of about $0.5B). Cash is falling (from $9.0B to $8.4B in one quarter), $2.0B is current, and both ratings were downgraded. At a Q1-like burn plus the dividend, this runs down quickly."
 },
 {
