 "why_questionable": "ROIC is company-defined and non-GAAP, and it is held up by an asset-light model and by a numerator that includes the one-off tariff benefit. EBIT margin of 8.3% (down from 12.7%) and a 2-year decline in revenue point to pricing power loss. The qualitative analysis itself admits the moat figures rest on unverified single-point sources. A third of the market-share figures come from low-quality SWOT sites."
 },
 {
